Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:11.41,Default,WOODCUTTER,0,0,0,,Man, it's cold... Better hurry \Nhome so I can have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:12.78,Default,VOICE (SALAMANDRA),0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:19.24,Default,VOICE (SALAMANDRA),0,0,0,,Please... help... Help me, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:22.37,Default,WOODCUTTER,0,0,0,,Who's there?! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.15,0:02:04.52,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SEARCHING FOR A FAMILIAR IS TOO DIFFICULT!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.86,0:02:04.52,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"Searching for a Familiar \NIs Too Difficult!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:08.77,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hey, Doux! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:10.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:18.30,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux?! Did you save another \Npeculiar creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:22.54,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This is the Mr. Lizard I saved \Nfrom the river the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:32.28,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,He turned {\i1}this{\i0} big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:37.78,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,The other day...? You've been \Ntaking care of it ever since?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:38.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:45.01,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I've been feeding him every day, \Nbathing him, and sleeping with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:49.40,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm? Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:51.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here, open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:52.69,top,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux... the only ones you \Nshould be taking care of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:54.27,top,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,are demons or magical beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:59.40,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Honestly, what are we going to do \Nabout everything clinging to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:01.29,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:03.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:06.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This actually works in our favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:09.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Look, look! Isn't he cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:10.41,top,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Jahi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:14.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I will be conducting a trial in \Nmaking pacts today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:15.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Pacts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:17.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Magical beast pacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's rather worrisome if Lady Doux were \Nto go outside the castle while we're away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:22.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,since she lacks any sense of caution...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.55,0:03:25.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So we will have her form a pact
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.38,0:03:28.91,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and have the magical beast that \Nis her familiar protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:30.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Creatures quickly take \Na liking to Lady Doux,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:34.06,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,so she should be able to form a pact with \Na magical beast without fighting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:38.46,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see! The more ways to \Nprotect her, the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:39.82,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well done, Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:42.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your praise honors me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:47.05,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But I had also previously given \NDoux a staff to help protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.04,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,It opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.41,0:04:03.72,flashback,ASSIM,0,0,0,,What just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:05.90,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wanna touch your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:12.06,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-That staff is a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:15.54,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hm... I guess that staff didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:21.06,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,In that case, my latest creation \Nis the slaughter pendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:22.74,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Let us be on our way, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:32.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, there are two ways to form \Na pact with a magical beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:38.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Give them some of your blood, and if they \Naccept it, that creates a blood pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.74,0:04:42.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The other method is to create a pact\N using magic, called a magic pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:46.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Magical beasts are beasts \Nthat possess magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:49.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Form a pact, and the magical beast will \Nuse that magic to fight alongside you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:51.74,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and sometimes become your shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:54.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They are your loyal minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:55.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.37,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Which means... no matter what happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:05:00.37,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,the one you form a pact with \Nwill always be by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:03.71,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then Doux wants to form a \Npact with Mr. Lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.29,0:05:06.83,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I don't sense any magic from that lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It is impossible to form a \Npact with a normal lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:11.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:14.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,First, let us find a magical beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.35,0:05:17.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Is that a magical beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:19.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:20.61,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:21.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:22.48,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What about...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:23.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It is not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:27.26,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm... We sure aren't finding \Nany magical beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:34.68,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,The animals love her... Perhaps this \Nis a "pact" in its own way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:39.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.20,0:05:41.55,Default,VOICE,0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:42.57,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:47.19,Default,VOICE,0,0,0,,Please... help. Help... me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:51.08,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Ah! Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:05:59.49,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,H-Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:04.21,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,Please... I beg of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:05.92,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It talked!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:09.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What is a Salamandra doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:11.24,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please step back, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:15.79,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ouchie, ouchie, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:17.08,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:19.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Don't use your magic on \Nsuch frivolous things!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.88,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Did the ouchie go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:24.98,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:31.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You can't go around saving everything \Nas if it's the same as breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:33.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Please be my familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A Salamandra isn't a magical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:39.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Not to mention, the way you're trying to \Nform a pact is totally wrong, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:40.99,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:43.19,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:45.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What brought that on sudde...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:50.72,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.57,Default,PISHACHA A,0,0,0,,Hunting... failed...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.21,Default,PISHACHA B,0,0,0,,Because you yelled...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:58.48,Default,PISHACHA B,0,0,0,,You yelled "Run"... You betrayed us...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:01.48,Default,PISHACHA C,0,0,0,,Because... Salamandra betray us...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.51,0:07:03.30,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:14.62,Default,BOSS,0,0,0,,Yes... Obey, Salamandra... \NThere won't be a next time...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:16.34,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The Salamandra...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:21.56,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A proud and noble dragon \Nthat controls fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:23.88,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,is being controlled by these small fry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:25.18,Default,PISHACHA A,0,0,0,,Small fry...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:27.32,Default,PISHACHA B,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:33.22,Default,PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,Swords, bludgeoning, fire, and ice \Nall have no effect on us...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.86,Default,PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,We are pishachas...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:38.72,Default,PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,We are demons that lurk in the shadows...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.57,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Pishachas? I've never \Nheard that name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:43.48,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Are they demons from another world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:46.78,Default,BOSS,0,0,0,,We don't need this useless \Ndragon anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:49.86,Default,BOSS,0,0,0,,It is now merely flesh \Nthat we will consume...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:53.34,Default,BOSS,0,0,0,,Are you also delicious flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:55.74,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This isn't good... Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:08:01.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh? I tried to fix them and they melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:04.24,Default,SLIME PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,We feel so refreshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.24,0:08:06.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So they're weak against healing magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:10.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, make the \Nothers feel better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:13.10,Default,PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:16.44,top,PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,W-Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.44,0:08:18.26,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ouchie, ouchie, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.14,Default,PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:22.34,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,The ouchie went away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.91,Default,SLIME PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,Refreshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:28.15,Default,BOSS,0,0,0,,I-Impossible! She's just a little brat...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:31.25,Default,BOSS,0,0,0,,Curse you... In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:38.28,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:40.74,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow! So big!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:40.74,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:48.84,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ouchie, ouchie, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:52.84,Default,GIANT PISHACHA,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:06.43,Default,GIANT PISHACHA,0,0,0,,I-Impossible! Pishachas are immortal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.37,0:09:08.94,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.71,0:09:18.45,Default,SLIME PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,Refreshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:21.27,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:24.45,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,I know I was being controlled,\Nbut what I did was awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.45,0:09:27.24,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,I must repay you with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.24,0:09:29.11,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Before that, I need to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:33.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You were working with them, \Nso why did you yell, "Run"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:34.97,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:38.09,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,atop her head...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:41.56,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,That dragon is my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:42.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:43.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:48.60,flashback,PISHACHAS,0,0,0,,Join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:49.48,flashback,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:56.32,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,When the pishachas captured me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:59.13,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,I risked my life to \Nlet my little one escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:05.30,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,Because you took my child \Nin and fought valiantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:08.08,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,I learned that my child was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:13.60,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,I cannot repay this great debt \Nby becoming your familiar,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.17,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,but I give my life to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:17.47,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,So please boil me or \Ncook me as you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:20.02,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,Just please, spare my child...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:23.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,If you can't be my familiar, \Nthen let's be family!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:27.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,If we're family, we'll all \Nbe able to stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Right? Big Sister Jahi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:35.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, not "Right?"!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:38.25,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Though, I mean, she would \Nprove to be a powerful ally...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:43.62,Default,SALAMANDRA,0,0,0,,I, Salamandra, swear to \Nprotect you with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:45.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:53.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Even if I allow this, there's no \Nguarantee that the demon king will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:56.38,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:11:01.39,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I never thought you would manage \Nto recruit a Salamandra!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:04.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This Mr. Lizard was her baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:08.52,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Is that so? I guess all \Nyour care paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:10.92,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,My child is so brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.09,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,All right! We'll throw a sweet \Npotato party to celebrate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.50,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,since Doux loves them so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:16.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:25.53,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE PAIRIKA IS TOO SEXY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:24.92,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Pairika Is Too Sexy!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:27.71,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,The torture isn't working?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:32.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. We captured a rather \Nsuspicious man outside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:37.55,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We were trying to get him to \Ntell us what he was plotting...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:40.74,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But none of our torture \Nmethods have been successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:45.30,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So you're trying to come \Nup with another method?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:48.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. I was hoping to get \Nyour thoughts on this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.17,0:11:49.27,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:53.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you... d-doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:00.24,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What are you...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:03.36,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,L-Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:09.12,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:13.87,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Well done, Doux! That was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:17.29,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,The "Draw on Her Face with \NLipstick" plan was a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:18.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thaiti?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:21.62,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That makeup looks great on you, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:23.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yeah! It looks great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:26.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Who is that? Do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:29.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes... Well, we trained together, \Nand I can't seem to be rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:33.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,After training, I was assigned \Nto the combat unit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:37.75,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,while Thaiti was assigned to the \Nseduction witches, the Pairika.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:43.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The Pairika are a special unit \Ncomprised of female demons who
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:45.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,specialize in seducing men...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:48.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,But she's been stuck as \Nan apprentice forever
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:47.85,top,DOUX/THAITI,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:50.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,because all she ever does is pull pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:51.41,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:55.25,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What are you even doing with \NLady Doux in the first place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:56.17,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:59.54,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,It's because this little \None became my apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.17,flashback,THAITI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:05.18,flashback,THAITI,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:07.05,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:12.23,flashback,THAITI,0,0,0,,Wait, aren't you the demon king's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:15.06,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,Lady, this is funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:22.32,flashback,THAITI,0,0,0,,You've got some potential, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:29.57,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Thaiti is Doux's \Npranks teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.57,0:13:30.95,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:34.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The last title a forever apprentice \Nlike yourself deserves is "master."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:39.02,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Oh? Are you really one to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:41.59,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Doux told me all about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:46.59,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,You're giving Doux here \Ntrials to become a proper demon, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.59,0:13:49.55,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're having some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:54.15,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here to \Ngive you some suggestions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:56.79,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,A trial of seduction that'll \Nwork better than torture!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.10,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.20,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Seduction?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:06.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ooh, I wanna try that! Doux \Nwants to try seduction!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.31,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,What? Don't tell me you taught \Nanything like that to Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:11.95,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so proud of you, my daughter! \NYou're so enthusiastic about these trials!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.04,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:16.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What's seduction mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:24.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's the man I mentioned earlier. \NNo torture seems to work on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:28.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,He is quite the villain, \Nso do be careful, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:29.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.67,0:14:33.39,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,If you let me handle it, \Nit'll be easy as pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.39,0:14:35.49,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:39.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm fairly certain I asked for an actual \NPairika who can show her how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:42.07,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Well, I'm the most knowledgeable \Nabout this trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:43.90,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I'm a professional, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:45.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Professional prankster, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:49.99,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,You don't even know how to torture \Npeople properly, so keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:53.96,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I have every method of\N seduction stored in my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:56.75,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Demonstrating any of them is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:14:59.37,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Just you watch, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:00.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, forever apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.05,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,You and those giant udders that're \Nwasted on you can shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:07.88,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I'll show you how it's really \Ndone, so keep your mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:11.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You two must be really close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:12.64,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,How...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.09,0:15:15.76,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Hey, mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.39,0:15:23.77,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Aren't you tired of being trapped here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.77,0:15:26.78,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Stop holding onto those secrets...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:29.78,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Let it all out...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.27,0:15:32.59,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Then you can have some fun with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:34.93,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,And feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.79,0:15:38.54,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,Th-That was perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:41.00,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,There's no way anyone \Nwouldn't fall for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:43.32,italics,THAITI,0,0,0,,I did that perfectly, just \Nlike the manual said!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:45.14,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,How do you like {\i1}that{\i0}, Jahi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:47.70,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Now I can be just like my sisters and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:48.55,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:49.39,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:52.55,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,You're gonna piss your mom off \Nbeing precocious like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:55.69,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,A little brat like you should go back \Nhome and suck on your mommy's teats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:15:59.93,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I'll murder you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:01.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:03.83,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Don't kill him before \Nhe tells us his secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:06.71,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,But he was mean and mocking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.71,0:16:10.69,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard I've worked \Nto get men to fall for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:12.32,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,J-Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.65,0:16:14.70,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I can't handle any \Nmore secondhand embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.13,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Embarrassment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:18.15,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Well then why don't {\i1}you{\i0} try it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:19.47,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,You're just all talk anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:22.58,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Someone please stop this idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:26.46,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,All of you are so mean to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:29.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I figured this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:38.12,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,Are you next? No matter what you try—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:44.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I hear that men have a \Nweakness for bosoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:46.85,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:50.78,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,N-Not interested...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.27,0:16:52.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Or how about...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.64,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:01.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:11.30,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then I'll just... make you forget... \Nall about your little secrets by...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:12.75,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:19.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I can't... do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:20.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's indecent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:22.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Indecent, I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:27.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why must I offer my body to someone \NI'm not even interested in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.70,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:30.07,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,You're the one who—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.39,0:17:31.33,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Is that seduction, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:33.07,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,No, that's just violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.77,0:17:35.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.97,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:43.42,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I... just wanted to get back at everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.97,0:17:54.97,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I have a body of a child, and everyone \Naround me treats me like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:58.84,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I know very well that I'm \Nnot suited for seduction...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:02.26,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,But I don't have any other talents...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:05.80,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,So no matter where I go... I'm just \Ngoing to get left behind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:10.43,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That's why I thought that if \NI was able to do this trial,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.82,0:18:12.82,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,everyone would finally accept me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:18.47,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,And my selfishness just \Nended up ruining your trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:20.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But you didn't ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:25.42,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I did ruin it! There's nothing \NI can teach you, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:27.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But you {\i1}did{\i0} teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:29.96,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,But I haven't done anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:34.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But you did teach me, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.79,0:18:37.38,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,That's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:38.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.76,0:18:40.64,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:43.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:45.89,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you gonna try now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:48.73,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's have a staring contest...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:49.39,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.39,0:18:51.90,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,If you laugh you're gonna lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:54.65,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,W-Wait, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:01.53,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This is Doux's serious face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:05.59,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,H-Hey... just what are you \Ntrying to do, you little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:12.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tickle, tickle, tickle...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:17.17,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,S-Stop! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:16.62,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tickle, tickle, tickle...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:18.61,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:20.22,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,Y-You didn't win anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.24,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,Tickling someone is playing dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:25.47,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,Also, if the one who laughs \Nfirst loses, then you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:27.56,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This is Doux's serious face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:30.56,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,Those scribbles... Now I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:35.82,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,How stupid! Like I'd tell you my secrets \Neven if I lost at this nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:40.20,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tickle, tickle, tickle...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.69,0:19:40.20,top,MAN,0,0,0,,That was a lie! I was just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:42.70,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,I'll talk! I'll talk, so please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:46.88,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,I'm the one who painted \Non the castle walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.45,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.45,0:19:52.05,Default,MAN,0,0,0,,So... please, just stop tickling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:55.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:57.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Torture and seduction didn't \Nwork at all, yet this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,childish prank got to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:02.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait! It was so much trouble \Nto get that off the walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:04.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So {\i1}you{\i0} were the one responsible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.34,0:20:06.36,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:11.60,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,This was all according to plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:16.84,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,A trial like this is nothing \Nwhen Doux and I work together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:17.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Now, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:20.37,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be \Na trial of seduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:23.29,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Not to mention, Lady Doux was \Nthe one who made him confess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:25.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:26.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:30.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I was able to do this because \NMaster taught me how to do pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:34.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Thaiti is my \Npranks master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:37.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,That was a huge success, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:38.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:40.30,Default,BOTH,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:44.05,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Okay! Now, let's start \Nthe trial of pranks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:48.07,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"PRANK TIME"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: YURI MORITA\NSONG: DOUX & THAITI
